This portable implementation develops the author's earlier ZeroThink concepts:
evidence-first research processes, deterministic source retrieval, and bounded
draft, critique and revision orchestration. It was created with coding-assistant
help. Source provenance and design limitations are recorded in PROVENANCE.json.

This distribution does not contain the old hosted PHP service, private user
records, credentials, DNA data, payment integration, entitlement service,
commercial encryption code, or third-party model weights.
